{
  "code": "ADT_A47",
  "name": "Change patient identifier list",
  "version": "HL7 v2.3.1",
  "chapter": "Patient Administration",
  "description": "A change has been done at the internal identifier level.  That is, a single PID-3-patient identifier list value has been found to be incorrect and has been changed.\n\nAn A47 event is used to signal a change of an incorrectly assigned PID-3-patient identifier list value.  The “incorrect source identifier” value is stored in the MRG segment (MRG-1-prior patient identifier list) and is to be changed to the “correct target patient ID” value stored in the PID segment (PID-3-patient identifier list).",
